"scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[1]}],"link":"29612","synopsis":"Chapter 1:\n\nPriest Myoue and his wife, Koto, and three children, live in Enzanji temple in Kyoto. The people around them find them creepy, so they decide to move to the Looking Glass City.\n\nChapter 2:\n\nThe family is happy, but Koto has a dream where disaster strikes the city, so the parents leave their children behind.\n\nChapter 3:\n\nWith the parents gone, the children are left to run the city for themselves. One day, a girl called Koto appears.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/k0tAwrK6L7yOgAVWxmyn9rsMGPV.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 1","synopsis":"Chapter 1:\n\nPriest Myoue and his wife, Koto, and three children, live in Enzanji temple in Kyoto. The people around them find them creepy, so they decide to move to the Looking Glass City.\n\nChapter 2:\n\nThe family is happy, but Koto has a dream where disaster strikes the city, so the parents leave their children behind.\n\nChapter 3:\n\nWith the parents gone, the children are left to run the city for themselves. One day, a girl called Koto appears.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/k0tAwrK6L7yOgAVWxmyn9rsMGPV.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 2","episodeNumber":2,"sourceEpisodeNumber":2,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"9992","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"19703","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"mal","id":"19703","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"85065","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"254658","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"254658","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"29607","synopsis":"Chapter 4:\n\nIn the past, Koto lived with Inari, who worked for the Chief Priest of the shrine and was also her teacher.\n\nChapter 5:\n\nShe realized that Inari may be her real dad, and that the black rabbit in the picture may really be her mother, but kept it a secret.\n\nChapter 6:\n\nIn the present Looking Glass City, the Council of Three thinks that Koto's red eyes may be a sign of their mother's return.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hhl05cW1iPpPdtr6RdAmvSa9TOY.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 2","synopsis":"Chapter 4:\n\nIn the past, Koto lived with Inari, who worked for the Chief Priest of the shrine and was also her teacher.\n\nChapter 5:\n\nShe realized that Inari may be her real dad, and that the black rabbit in the picture may really be her mother, but kept it a secret.\n\nChapter 6:\n\nIn the present Looking Glass City, the Council of Three thinks that Koto's red eyes may be a sign of their mother's return.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hhl05cW1iPpPdtr6RdAmvSa9TOY.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"9992","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"19703","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"19703","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"85065","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"254658","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"254658","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"29608","synopsis":"Chapter 7:\n\nKurama, the de-facto ruler of Looking Glass City, tells Koto that their mother is the black rabbit.\n\nChapter 8:\n\nKurama has been intellectually curious from a young age, and loved it when his father praised his inventions. He wants to find what he can do outside of the Looking Glass City.\n\nChapter 9:\n\nThe identities of Doctor Shouko and Fushimi are revealed...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tBf7CSmy2OIKhUMYPtxM4pD4Tnl.jpg","metadataSources":{"