 back, but...\n\nChapter 12:\n\nKoto tries to fix things between Kurama and Yase, and feels a connection to her mother between them.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sLHF2xQGVxrVzaqGHXUxkzd7W5H.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"9992","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"19703","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"19703","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"85065","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"254658","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"254658","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"29613","synopsis":"Chapter 13:\n\nMyoue has been skipping out on the Council of Three meetings, and now he feels irritated at the fun Koto is having.\n\nChapter 14:\n\nBut his anger isn't really directed at her, it's at himself, and how he acted when he was still called Yakushimaru.\n\nChapter 15:\n\nHe takes Koto to the no-go zone on his bike, and offers her a plan.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/A5XiKnhRi6nWsp8ZYpOZEWxSH1q.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 5","synopsis":"Chapter 13:\n\nMyoue has been skipping out on the Council of Three meetings, and now he feels irritated at the fun Koto is having.\n\nChapter 14:\n\nBut his anger isn't really directed at her, it's at himself, and how he acted when he was still called Yakushimaru.\n\nChapter 15:\n\nHe takes Koto to the no-go zone on his bike, and offers her a plan.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/A5XiKnhRi6nWsp8ZYpOZEWxSH1q.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"9992","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilis