l destroy everything.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fnmZah1BJKfDlVlOG9xzWi6wYBk.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 8","synopsis":"A shock wave and asteroid strike the Looking Glass City as the people run and the town beguns to collapse. This was caused by Koto's use of Aratama. The Shrine and Chief Priest appear, and the truth of the city is revealed... Koto says that if they don't save the city and the people, she'll destroy everything.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fnmZah1BJKfDlVlOG9xzWi6wYBk.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"9992","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"19703","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"19703","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"85065","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"254658","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"254658","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"29615","synopsis":"Inari is moved by Koto's desire to know the truth of the looking glass city, and starts to tell her the secrets of the universe. When he's done he stabs her with his sword. The others are shocked. Koto's Aratama explodes and the world is destroyed. Myoue confronts Kurama and Yase amidst the rubble. Myoue awakens as the true king of the city, and runs to stop the end of the world.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7R0MkB6Ftnh9vtKSdw7vftI1mBc.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 9","synopsis":"Inari is moved by Koto's desire to know the truth of the looking glass city, and starts to tell her the secrets of the universe. When he's done he stabs her with his sword. The others are shocked. Koto's Aratama explodes and the world is destroyed. Myoue confronts Kurama and Yase amidst the rubble